         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Background: Clinically, only a minority of patients benefit from immunotherapy and few efficient biomarkers have been identified to distinguish patients who would respond to immunotherapy</rdf:li>
